WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.366
The destruction of Kalos continues, brought on by Team Flare.

2
00:00:08.033 --> 00:00:12.500
However, Serena, along with Mairin, successfully rescued Chespie.

3
00:00:14.066 --> 00:00:16.033
With Blaziken Mask at her side,

4
00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:18.966
Bonnie stood before Zygarde to stop its rampage.

5
00:00:19.166 --> 00:00:24.166
With a song, an exhausted Squishy was soon freed from Team Flare's control.

6
00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:30.666
Clemont and Clembot successfully destroyed Team Flare's control system

7
00:00:30.733 --> 00:00:33.400
and released the other Zygarde from its grip.

8
00:00:36.166 --> 00:00:38.733
However, it came at a price,

9
00:00:39.166 --> 00:00:41.500
the complete loss of Clembot's memory.

10
00:00:41.933 --> 00:00:45.700
It was a heart-wrenching decision Clemont was forced to make.

11
00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:50.966
Meanwhile, Ash and Alain are in the heat of battle.

12
00:00:51.033 --> 00:00:52.733
Use Hyper Beam!

13
00:00:53.866 --> 00:00:55.733
Pikachu, use Quick Attack!

14
00:00:57.633 --> 00:01:01.866
- Keep up the heat! Use Dragon Claw!
- Greninja, use Cut, now!

15
00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.133
Pikachu, Thunderbolt, go!

16
00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:11.766
Pikachu!

17
00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:26.733
It appears the fighting instinct you've spoken of is a thing of the past.

18
00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:28.466
It's all over, Lysandre.

19
00:01:31.366 --> 00:01:33.300
All your petty talk...

20
00:01:35.166 --> 00:01:37.866
it will never extinguish my dream.

21
00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:43.200
I'm still committed to recreating this world.

22
00:01:44.733 --> 00:01:45.566
Greninja!

23
00:01:51.866 --> 00:01:52.700
Lysandre!

24
00:02:08.933 --> 00:02:11.733
- Ash?
- Serena, where are you guys now?

25
00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:15.633
We're at Lysandre Labs, and we just rescued Chespie.

26
00:02:16.233 --> 00:02:19.733
Professor Sycamore and Steven are here with us at the lab.

27
00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:22.033
Mairin, are you there?

28
00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:23.933
I'm here, with Chespie.

29
00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:25.300
Are you okay, Alain?

30
00:02:25.766 --> 00:02:27.466
I'm fine. How are you?

31
00:02:27.533 --> 00:02:29.366
I'm fine. Chespie's safe, too.

32
00:02:30.133 --> 00:02:32.033
That's great news, Alain.

33
00:02:32.100 --> 00:02:36.066
- Ash, what's your location?
- At the top of Prism Tower.

34
00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:39.866
Could I ask you to go to the gym?

35
00:02:40.333 --> 00:02:41.300
It's Clemont.

36
00:02:47.933 --> 00:02:51.233
♪ I stand tall 'Cause I know I'm a winner ♪

37
00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:55.633
♪ Knock me down I'll just get up again ♪

38
00:02:55.700 --> 00:02:58.600
♪ You've met your match Yeah, I'm no beginner ♪

39
00:02:58.666 --> 00:03:01.800
♪ Pokémon, Pokémon ♪

40
00:03:01.866 --> 00:03:03.600
♪ Gotta catch 'em all ♪

41
00:03:03.666 --> 00:03:06.833
♪ I stand tall 'Cause I know I'm a winner ♪

42
00:03:06.900 --> 00:03:09.966
♪ Pokémon, Pokémon ♪

43
00:03:10.033 --> 00:03:11.600
♪ Gotta catch 'em all ♪

44
00:03:24.033 --> 00:03:26.300
- Use Sludge Bomb!
- Use Ice Beam!

45
00:03:28.033 --> 00:03:29.866
Wobbuffet, Mirror Coat!

46
00:03:36.666 --> 00:03:40.100
- All right, James, use String Shot.
- I'm not a Bug Type.

47
00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:45.400
- Let us go!
- Not cool.

48
00:03:46.766 --> 00:03:48.700
Team Flare, catch of the day.

49
00:03:54.833 --> 00:03:56.000
What are you doing?

50
00:03:56.200 --> 00:04:00.066
I'm finding out what kind of research was being conducted here.

51
00:04:00.566 --> 00:04:01.600
Ah.

52
00:04:03.133 --> 00:04:03.966
There it is.

53
00:04:05.833 --> 00:04:06.666
What is it?

54
00:04:15.766 --> 00:04:16.833
What's happening?

55
00:04:25.233 --> 00:04:26.200
Chespie.

56
00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:28.766
Hey!

57
00:04:31.633 --> 00:04:32.566
Chespie!

58
00:04:33.166 --> 00:04:34.033
Mairin, wait!

59
00:04:36.433 --> 00:04:39.800
- But Chespie disappeared!
- It's dangerous.

60
00:04:46.333 --> 00:04:49.833
- Chespie! No!
- We've got to get away, Mairin!

61
00:05:04.033 --> 00:05:05.000
Chespie.

62
00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:09.266
Professor Sycamore, what's happening?

63
00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:12.433
I have no idea. Is the Giant Rock involved?

64
00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:15.833
Involved? I'm certain the Giant Rock is the source.

65
00:05:16.800 --> 00:05:18.433
Anything can happen now.

66
00:05:24.133 --> 00:05:26.400
- Heads up.
- What is that thing?

67
00:05:26.633 --> 00:05:29.766
To prepare you for trouble, we're sensing a scoop.

68
00:05:31.500 --> 00:05:34.533
We're a double-edged news gathering group.

69
00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:39.166
- To protect the world and not tell a lie.
- To unite people wherever we fly.

70
00:05:39.233 --> 00:05:43.533
- To denounce the evils of staying mute.
- To extend our reach while staying cute.

71
00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:45.333
- Jessie.
- And James.

72
00:05:45.966 --> 00:05:49.033
Team Rocket shows the headline with a bright light.

73
00:05:49.100 --> 00:05:52.033
Team Flare has fizzled. We fought the good fight.

74
00:05:52.266 --> 00:05:53.533
Meowth, that's right.

75
00:05:53.800 --> 00:05:55.433
Wobbuffet.

76
00:06:05.566 --> 00:06:07.766
The sundial is starting to tremble.

77
00:06:13.366 --> 00:06:14.233
Clemont!

78
00:06:14.633 --> 00:06:16.133
Pika!

79
00:06:24.833 --> 00:06:26.266
What happened, Clemont?

80
00:06:28.966 --> 00:06:30.266
Clembot did it all.

81
00:06:34.333 --> 00:06:35.966
Can Clembot be fixed?

82
00:06:36.633 --> 00:06:37.833
I'll do my best.

83
00:06:39.366 --> 00:06:41.700
I haven't been of any use so far.

84
00:06:47.233 --> 00:06:48.066
What's up?

85
00:06:48.900 --> 00:06:50.566
Ash, it's an emergency.

86
00:06:50.833 --> 00:06:53.833
The Giant Rock at Lysandre Labs absorbed Chespie.

87
00:06:54.300 --> 00:06:56.333
- Huh?
- Absorbed Chespie?

88
00:06:57.166 --> 00:06:59.600
That Giant Rock's on the move somewhere.

89
00:07:00.533 --> 00:07:03.400
I don't know where. I'm sending our coordinates.

90
00:07:03.466 --> 00:07:05.600
Get here fast, bring Blaziken Mask.

91
00:07:06.633 --> 00:07:09.866
We're gonna track its movements and analyze as we can.

92
00:07:09.933 --> 00:07:11.400
Ash, please be careful.

93
00:07:11.866 --> 00:07:12.700
I will.

94
00:07:14.166 --> 00:07:15.266
Hey, Clemont?

95
00:07:18.600 --> 00:07:20.133
I'm all right.

96
00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:23.400
The battle isn't over just yet.

97
00:07:34.366 --> 00:07:38.133
Yay! Hello there. I'm good friends with Squishy.

98
00:07:42.566 --> 00:07:44.266
Look at this devastation.

99
00:07:44.700 --> 00:07:46.533
The humans did this.

100
00:07:47.066 --> 00:07:50.133
This is why they're so evil.

101
00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:52.633
I believe in humans.

102
00:07:53.766 --> 00:07:55.600
How can you say such a thing?

103
00:07:56.733 --> 00:07:59.633
Because these humans haven't given up yet.

104
00:08:04.900 --> 00:08:07.700
Oh, please, come here. Don't be scared.

105
00:08:08.366 --> 00:08:10.200
Why don't you come with us?

106
00:08:13.766 --> 00:08:16.700
Being on a journey with this girl and her friends

107
00:08:16.766 --> 00:08:19.200
has allowed me to witness many things.

108
00:08:20.833 --> 00:08:23.800
They help each other. They work hard.

109
00:08:24.200 --> 00:08:26.400
They share their happiness together.

110
00:08:26.700 --> 00:08:28.166
They trust each other.

111
00:08:28.366 --> 00:08:32.500
They move forward together, and they never give up.

112
00:08:32.900 --> 00:08:35.533
That's how the humans I travel with are.

113
00:08:37.633 --> 00:08:41.100
If Squishy's a friend of yours, then I'm your friend, too.

114
00:08:41.600 --> 00:08:44.466
I won't hurt you. I wanna be your friend.

115
00:08:47.333 --> 00:08:48.300
Okay?

116
00:08:49.866 --> 00:08:53.666
When I tickle Squishy under the chin like this, then it laughs.

117
00:09:04.300 --> 00:09:07.766
Listen, I wanna tell you what I know about the Giant Rock.

118
00:09:08.966 --> 00:09:12.700
When we scanned it, we discovered it's a giant mass of energy.

119
00:09:12.766 --> 00:09:15.866
A mass of energy that strongly resembles Zygarde's.

120
00:09:18.366 --> 00:09:22.400
In addition, we picked up Chespie's vital signs within its core.

121
00:09:22.866 --> 00:09:27.133
We found and retrieved Chespie's records located in the lab's database.

122
00:09:27.900 --> 00:09:29.533
According to those records,

123
00:09:29.600 --> 00:09:33.333
an accident caused Chespie to absorb some of Zygarde's energy.

124
00:09:34.366 --> 00:09:37.266
We're think that the Giant Rock absorbed Chespie

125
00:09:37.533 --> 00:09:39.866
in order obtain that energy.

126
00:09:40.766 --> 00:09:44.600
But now the Giant Rock is in search of its next energy source.

127
00:09:47.766 --> 00:09:48.800
Isn't that--?

128
00:09:48.866 --> 00:09:50.200
It's Anistar City.

129
00:09:50.666 --> 00:09:51.900
Anistar City?

130
00:09:51.966 --> 00:09:53.166
Pika?

131
00:09:53.266 --> 00:09:55.133
It's headed toward the sundial.

132
00:09:56.433 --> 00:10:00.433
The sundial is a giant crystal said to have come from space.

133
00:10:00.666 --> 00:10:02.933
We know that the energy it contains

134
00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:05.933
is the very same energy that Pokémon emit

135
00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:08.533
when they're experiencing Mega Evolution.

136
00:10:09.133 --> 00:10:11.933
Say the Giant Rock is drawn toward that energy,

137
00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:13.800
why that energy, though?

138
00:10:14.500 --> 00:10:15.633
I know why.

139
00:10:16.133 --> 00:10:19.500
If the Giant Rock and the sundial come in direct contact

140
00:10:19.566 --> 00:10:21.366
and then merge as a result...

141
00:10:29.766 --> 00:10:33.333
- Then that means...
- It means it's the end of the world.

142
00:10:34.866 --> 00:10:37.766
Lysandre, recreating the world at any cost.

143
00:10:37.833 --> 00:10:39.433
We won't let that happen.

144
00:10:40.300 --> 00:10:44.666
Professor, we gotta rescue Chespie and stop the Giant Rock right away.

145
00:10:44.733 --> 00:10:45.566
Pikachu!

146
00:10:46.233 --> 00:10:48.066
We can and we will.

147
00:10:49.833 --> 00:10:51.700
Okay. We're with you.

148
00:10:52.166 --> 00:10:53.000
Awesome!
Pika!

149
00:10:56.366 --> 00:10:57.200
Mairin.

150
00:10:58.566 --> 00:11:01.200
I promise, I'm going to save Chespie.

151
00:11:03.533 --> 00:11:04.366
Thanks.

152
00:11:05.733 --> 00:11:07.833
Who's that Pokémon?

153
00:11:12.366 --> 00:11:14.966
- It's Weavile!
- Weavile!

154
00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:25.666
That's everything Professor Sycamore told us.

155
00:11:26.133 --> 00:11:29.433
You need to evacuate the residents of Anistar at once.

156
00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:30.333
Right.

157
00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:33.366
The sundial can't be destroyed.

158
00:11:36.666 --> 00:11:37.566
Gather!

159
00:11:42.600 --> 00:11:46.533
The mysterious giant object is currently heading to Anistar City.

160
00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:50.000
Nearby residents should evacuate immediately!

161
00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:58.833
- Are you ready to go?
- Yeah.

162
00:11:59.266 --> 00:12:01.100
We wanna come and help, too.

163
00:12:01.166 --> 00:12:04.100
- Serena.
- If we don't, the world will end.

164
00:12:04.866 --> 00:12:07.733
And I can't bear the thought of that happening.

165
00:12:09.533 --> 00:12:11.100
Now, Metagross, go!

166
00:12:11.166 --> 00:12:13.100
Now, Garchomp, go!

167
00:12:13.566 --> 00:12:15.100
Braixen, come out!

168
00:12:21.733 --> 00:12:23.333
- Mega Evolve!
- Mega Evolve!

169
00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:41.733
Flash Cannon!

170
00:12:41.800 --> 00:12:44.333
- Use Dragon Pulse!
- Use Flamethrower!

171
00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:55.533
Dragon Pulse, let's go!

172
00:12:58.133 --> 00:13:00.266
- Use Flamethrower!
- Flash Cannon!

173
00:13:00.333 --> 00:13:01.500
Braixen!

174
00:13:04.166 --> 00:13:05.966
Hey, check out the Twerpette!

175
00:13:08.900 --> 00:13:09.866
Garchomp, no!

176
00:13:09.933 --> 00:13:10.866
Braixen!

177
00:13:13.166 --> 00:13:14.366
Braixen!

178
00:13:14.800 --> 00:13:16.266
- No, Braixen!
- Metagross!

179
00:13:20.633 --> 00:13:22.733
- Pika!
- Braixen!

180
00:13:23.200 --> 00:13:25.300
- Charizard.
- And Pikachu.

181
00:13:32.766 --> 00:13:34.500
It's Ash and Clemont!

182
00:13:34.566 --> 00:13:36.000
And Alain!

183
00:13:38.433 --> 00:13:41.266
- Here they come.
- The gang is all here.

184
00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:44.766
Now, Charizard, Flamethrower!

185
00:13:44.833 --> 00:13:46.433
Pikachu, use Iron Tail!

186
00:14:02.800 --> 00:14:07.033
In order to stop the mysterious giant object in its mysterious tracks,

187
00:14:07.100 --> 00:14:09.100
Professor Sycamore and the Twer--

188
00:14:09.166 --> 00:14:12.633
I mean, Pokémon trainers are battling it with a vengeance.

189
00:14:13.400 --> 00:14:14.533
Take care, Ash.

190
00:14:23.766 --> 00:14:26.800
Professor, do you know Chespie's exact location?

191
00:14:27.300 --> 00:14:29.933
Scan shows Chespie is somewhere in its core.

192
00:14:35.933 --> 00:14:37.266
Ninja.

193
00:14:46.766 --> 00:14:49.166
Hey, Greninja, did you see it, too?

194
00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:52.733
Know what? I just got an idea.

195
00:14:53.233 --> 00:14:54.100
You with me?

196
00:14:54.533 --> 00:14:55.633
Ninja.

197
00:14:57.300 --> 00:14:58.766
Ash, are you sure?

198
00:14:59.666 --> 00:15:02.500
Of course. Just give us a chance.

199
00:15:07.166 --> 00:15:08.500
Ninja!

200
00:15:09.833 --> 00:15:14.366
- Make sure you've got Greninja's back!
- Charizard, you do the same as well!

201
00:15:14.433 --> 00:15:18.266
- Let's help Ash all that we can.
- That includes you, Metagross!

202
00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:24.633
Chespie, take care and be safe.

203
00:15:44.266 --> 00:15:47.566
There it is. Greninja, Water Shuriken!

204
00:15:51.733 --> 00:15:54.866
Right down there! Chespie's down under the shuriken.

205
00:15:55.966 --> 00:15:58.500
Everyone, head toward the water shuriken!

206
00:16:00.633 --> 00:16:02.133
Pikachu!

207
00:16:11.766 --> 00:16:13.900
Pikachu, Thunderbolt, let's go!

208
00:16:13.966 --> 00:16:17.766
Pikachu!

209
00:16:17.833 --> 00:16:19.433
Now, use Flamethrower!

210
00:16:26.133 --> 00:16:27.466
All right, Hyper Beam!

211
00:16:30.366 --> 00:16:31.466
Flash Cannon, go!

212
00:16:32.966 --> 00:16:34.200
Use Flamethrower!

213
00:16:37.266 --> 00:16:38.433
It's endless.

214
00:16:38.800 --> 00:16:41.733
At this rate, we won't even be able to get close.

215
00:16:44.700 --> 00:16:45.966
Quick, use cut!

216
00:16:46.033 --> 00:16:48.233
Greninja!

217
00:16:54.766 --> 00:16:56.300
- Pikachu, no!
- Charizard!

218
00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:02.400
- Braixen!
- Metagross!

219
00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:06.400
Oh, no, Garchomp.

220
00:17:06.900 --> 00:17:08.666
I'm not liking this one bit.

221
00:17:16.433 --> 00:17:18.366
Aah! What's going on?

222
00:17:31.633 --> 00:17:33.133
- Excuse me?
- Excuse me?

223
00:17:38.733 --> 00:17:40.166
Pika!

224
00:17:40.600 --> 00:17:43.166
- Check it out.
- Look, all the gym leaders.

225
00:17:43.233 --> 00:17:44.900
Yippee!

226
00:17:45.466 --> 00:17:47.066
And not a moment too soon.

227
00:17:47.966 --> 00:17:49.933
Sorry to keep you waiting.

228
00:17:51.966 --> 00:17:55.333
I'd say that thing won't stop, even if we ask it nicely.

229
00:17:58.200 --> 00:17:59.700
It sure is big.

230
00:17:59.933 --> 00:18:02.466
Now don't get distracted, okay, Grant?

231
00:18:04.666 --> 00:18:08.400
Yeah, yeah. Though it would be a really good wall to climb on.

232
00:18:10.666 --> 00:18:13.733
That plant is quite strong. We must stay focused.

233
00:18:13.866 --> 00:18:15.133
Let's go, Gogoat.

234
00:18:17.666 --> 00:18:19.766
Horrendous energy is everywhere.

235
00:18:23.333 --> 00:18:25.900
It must not make contact with the sundial.

236
00:18:28.633 --> 00:18:30.233
Then that means one thing.

237
00:18:30.300 --> 00:18:32.966
Let's go full throttle right from the start.

238
00:18:40.500 --> 00:18:42.366
That didn't even slow it down.

239
00:18:43.666 --> 00:18:46.666
Let's fall back and come up with a different plan.

240
00:18:50.366 --> 00:18:52.100
We all know the situation.

241
00:18:52.266 --> 00:18:54.666
Rescuing Chespie is our first priority.

242
00:18:55.133 --> 00:18:55.966
Right.

243
00:18:56.233 --> 00:18:59.933
Let's use the Pokémons' moves to get into the Giant Rock.

244
00:19:00.766 --> 00:19:02.100
The target is there.

245
00:19:03.600 --> 00:19:05.033
That water shuriken.

246
00:19:08.133 --> 00:19:10.433
We'll attack with our combined power.

247
00:19:10.633 --> 00:19:14.200
It is truly a sincere honor to battle alongside you.

248
00:19:14.666 --> 00:19:16.700
Steven, the honor is all mine.

249
00:19:17.400 --> 00:19:20.700
We couldn't have asked for a stronger group. Thank you.

250
00:19:20.766 --> 00:19:22.200
- Hi, Ash.
- Korrina.

251
00:19:22.666 --> 00:19:25.500
- So, this is the famous Greninja.
- Sure is.

252
00:19:25.566 --> 00:19:27.200
Its power merges with mine.

253
00:19:27.666 --> 00:19:28.500
Excellent.

254
00:19:28.966 --> 00:19:31.700
And now you've finally made that power yours.

255
00:19:32.166 --> 00:19:33.200
That's right.

256
00:19:38.400 --> 00:19:41.700
Everyone, you're looking at the final line of defense.

257
00:19:42.166 --> 00:19:47.000
We cannot let it come in contact with the sundial, remember that at all times.

258
00:19:49.433 --> 00:19:50.800
Let's go, Houndoom.

259
00:19:52.266 --> 00:19:55.166
Serena, take care of Mairin and Bonnie.

260
00:19:55.233 --> 00:19:57.433
- Pika!
- And thanks a lot for your help.

261
00:19:57.900 --> 00:20:00.166
- You got it. Leave it to me.
- Braixen.

262
00:20:00.233 --> 00:20:02.166
Now, all of you be careful.

263
00:20:03.400 --> 00:20:04.433
Alain?

264
00:20:04.900 --> 00:20:08.433
It's okay. I know I'll come back, and Chespie with me.

265
00:20:08.900 --> 00:20:09.733
Okay.

266
00:20:15.900 --> 00:20:17.666
Meowth, gotta catch them all.

267
00:20:17.733 --> 00:20:19.000
So, what else is new?

268
00:20:19.800 --> 00:20:22.666
Viewers the world over, this is history.

269
00:20:22.733 --> 00:20:27.166
Watch as these titans tackle the threat to Kalos and the world!

270
00:20:28.666 --> 00:20:31.433
To rescue Chespie and prevent the Giant Rock

271
00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:33.733
from coming into contact with the sundial,

272
00:20:33.800 --> 00:20:37.200
the most powerful team in Kalos has gathered together

273
00:20:37.266 --> 00:20:41.433
in a battle for the future of the world. What will be Chespie's fate?

274
00:20:41.533 --> 00:20:43.533
What will be the future of Kalos?

275
00:20:43.600 --> 00:20:47.966
The final decisive battle to come, as the journey continues.
